<title>USA: Midcoast Energy completes stock offering.</title>
<headline>Midcoast Energy completes stock offering.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Midcoast Energy Resources said it has completed a public offering of 2,415,000 shares of its common stock at a price of $16.00 a share.</p>
<p>The offering was managed by Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc., A.G. Edward &amp; Sons Inc and Coleman and Co as representatives of several underwriters.</p>
<p>The offering included 2,315,000 shares issued and sold by the company and 100,000 shares offered by a selling stockholder.</p>
</text>
